1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,790
Why are you wearing the Trump...
なんでトランプの…

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:04,580
excuse me...
いや、失礼

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,560
It's not Trump. It's not Trump.
トランプじゃない
トランプじゃないって

4
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:11,000
The Supreme Lives Matter.
その
“Supreme Lives Matter”

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:14,260
This is not Lives Matter. This
is Tremaine. This is Tremaine.
これは“Lives Matter”じゃない
Tremaineだよ　Tremaineだ

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,960
This is my boy that's
at Supreme now.
今Supremeにいる
俺の仲間

7
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,620
And the weird thing is,
like, you know,
妙な話だけどさ
あいつはいい奴なんだ

8
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,300
he's a good guy. He's a good guy.
いい奴なんだよ

9
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,540
So you think about,
like, Pete Davidson.
Pete Davidsonを考えてみろよ
あいつには

10
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:25,690
I gave him a negative
nickname, Skete Davidson.
悪いあだ名をつけた
“Skete Davidson”ってな

11
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:29,400
With Tremaine, I gave him something
that was even more powerful.
Tremaineには　もっと強いのをやった
Ye流に格上げして

12
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,500
I Ye'd him up. I gave
him Tremendous.
“Tremendous”ってあだ名をな

13
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,980
Right? And then we went
in. We appropriate...
で、乗り込んで
Supremeの全部を

14
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,070
we did a reverse appropriation
of everything Supreme.
“逆盗用”してやったんだ

15
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:39,360
And I went to the studio
with Ian Connor, right?
Ian Connorと
スタジオに入って

16
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,420
And we went, Supreme is this...
you know, it's a skate brand.
で、Supremeっていうのは

17
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,920
It's the high school, right?
You know what I'm saying?
スケートブランドで
高校生のノリなんだよ

18
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:46,760
So it's like, we went in
and flipped everything.
だから乗り込んで
全部ひっくり返したんだ

19
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:51,520
This thing is, so the Tremendous
movement is more...
これはさ
“Tremendousムーブメント”…

20
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,890
I don't want to call it a movement,
because you don't move nowhere.
いや、ムーブメントとは呼びたくない
どこにも動かないからな

21
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:58,120
That's like, the Tremendous idea is
so much bigger than even a t-shirt,
“Tremendous”って発想は
Tシャツなんかより　ずっとデカい

22
00:00:58,140 --> 00:00:59,550
the other t-shirt I wore.
前に着たTシャツよりもな

23
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:01,800
Like, this is finna go crazy.
これはヤバいことになるぞ

24
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:04,160
People are... love this, and they love,
みんな気に入ってる

25
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:07,130
because you got Dov Charney.
It's bigger than White Lives Matter.
Dov Charneyが付いてるからな
White Lives Matterよりデカい
